==Trivia==
The double rare print of this card features a special pattern behind its card text, which is shared with {{TCG ID|Triumphant Light|Arceus|70}} and eight other Pokémon in the {{TCGP|Triumphant Light}} expansion, all eight of which have a {{TCGP|Link Ability}} that is active or usable while any Arceus card is in play. All cards are also part of the "Pokémon with Abilities that "Link" with Arceus" [[Triumphant Light (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]], and the eight Pokémon with Link Abilities—{{p|Carnivine}}, {{p|Heatran}}, {{p|Abomasnow}}, {{p|Raichu}}, {{p|Rotom}}, {{p|Tyranitar}}, {{p|Crobat}}, and {{p|Magnezone}}—are featured in the card's immersive illustration.

===Origin===
*This card's shiny super rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Arceus}}.

